== Derived video timing ==

As of the time of writing (May 6, 2026), there is a known discrepancy between the [https://github.com/DragonMinded/libdragon/tree/preview preview branch of Libdragon] and prior definitions for PAL-M progressive signals. Currently, the Libdragon prevew branch uses a single previously MPAL interlaced-exclusive VI register configuration for both progressive and interlaced modes. Thus, the following tables do not apply to software using MPAL progressive in conjunction with the Libdragon preview branch.

From VCLK, the [[Video Interface]] counts VI clocks per line (L) and half-lines per frame (S) in conjunction with the leap configuration to produce the horizontal and vertical scan frequencies.<ref>Full derivations shown in the [https://github.com/meauxdal/N64-Refresh-Rate-Reference N64 Refresh Rate Reference].</ref>

{| class="wikitable" style="text-align: center;"
! Standard !! Scan !! <math>f_H</math> (Hz) !! <math>f_V</math> (Hz)
|-
| '''NTSC''' || Progressive || <math>\frac{2{,}250{,}000}{143}</math> || <math>\frac{2{,}250{,}000}{37{,}609}</math>
|-
| '''NTSC''' || Interlaced || <math>\frac{2{,}250{,}000}{143}</math> || <math>\frac{60{,}000}{1{,}001}</math>
|-
| '''PAL''' || Progressive || <math>\frac{5{,}550{,}890{,}675}{355{,}257}$ ||   <math>\frac{17{,}734{,}475}{355{,}257}</math>
|-
| '''PAL''' || Interlaced || <math>15{,}625</math> || <math>50</math>
|-
| '''MPAL''' || Progressive || <math>\frac{4{,}572{,}156{,}375{,}000}{290{,}532{,}671}</math> || <math>\frac{17{,}384{,}625{,}000}{290{,}532{,}671}</math>
|-
| '''MPAL''' || Interlaced || <math>\frac{71{,}583{,}750{,}000}{4{,}547{,}257}</math> || <math>\frac{272{,}700{,}000}{4{,}547{,}257}</math>
